@startuml DifyArchitecture
title 智慧医疗对话系统软件体系结构

' 定义包结构
package "用户界面层 (UI Layer)" {
  [UIClient]
}

package "业务逻辑层 (Business Logic Layer)" {
  [PromptManager]
  [LLMEngine]
  [KnowledgeInjector]
  [SessionManager]
  [APIGateway]
}

package "基础服务层 (Infrastructure Layer)" {
  [LLMBackend]
  [VectorDB]
  [MySQLDB]
}

' 依赖关系
[UIClient] --> [APIGateway] : 请求/响应
[APIGateway] --> [PromptManager] : 组装Prompt
[PromptManager] --> [KnowledgeInjector] : 检索知识
[PromptManager] --> [LLMEngine] : 调用模型
[KnowledgeInjector] --> [VectorDB] : 查询向量
[LLMEngine] --> [LLMBackend] : 模型推理
[SessionManager] --> [MySQLDB] : 存储会话记录

@enduml